# student of RealESRGAN x2plus, experiment of 2026-11-22. same size in and out, residual on the input luma, place after dither removal (default).
# trained to copy the luma of the big net's result (run on the frame, averaged back to the source size) on series s captures of one game
# and on ps5 pro footage of it. loss l1 + gradient l1. target kept only on strong one-directional or high contrast edges, the input elsewhere.
# 6 convs 3x3, 16 features, relu, 9585 weights. training steps: 2000 multi-branch + 1825 plain at lr 0.0002 + 8000 plain at lr 0.0002 (multi-branch = ecb-style blocks folded to plain 3x3). ema weights.
meyra-net 1
name GTA6 teach x2plus 6x16 edges
layer c0 conv k=3 in=y out=16 act=relu
